<title>UK: INSIGHT - Gold, silver, platinum seen rangebound.</title>
<headline>INSIGHT - Gold, silver, platinum seen rangebound.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>--------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p> SPOT     NY CLOSE  * SUPPORT * RESIST * RSI14 *   MA10 *   MA30</p>
<p> GOLD   325.80/6.30 *  321.00 * 328.00 *    47 * 325.39 * 327.24</p>
<p> SILVER   4.30/4.33 *    4.25 *   4.45 *    47 *   4.31     4.46</p>
<p> PLAT   428.50/9.50 *  420.00 * 430.00 *    61 * 419.75 * 414.26</p>
<p>-----------------VIEWS FROM THE MARKET - July 31--------------</p>
<p>Gold prices are expected to remain quiet and hold a narrow range on Thursday, traders and chartists said.</p>
<p>The market is likely to be capped on any move to $328.00 where it stalled on Wednesday, while initial support is pegged at $324.00, followed by a more robust level of $321.00, they said.</p>
